OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry
OL,6,Fovernight with cloud cover breaking at
OL,7,Ftimes to allow for some clear spells.
OL,8,FBecoming cold with a frost developing
OL,9,Fby dawn. Winds light but breezy along
OL,10,Fthe coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FCloudy through Friday with
OL,13,Fsome brighter spells during the
OL,14,Fmorning. Rain arrives into the west
OL,15,Fthrough the afternoon. Cold overnight,
OL,16,Fbut staying dry in the east with a
OL,17,Ffrost.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
